<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek GDP rises 1.5 pct in Jan-Sept year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Uzbek GDP rises 1.5 pct in Jan-Sept year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's gross domestic product in the first nine months of this year was 1.5 percent higher than in the same period a year earlier, Prime Minister Utkur Sultanov told the cabinet, the official Narodnoye Slovo daily said.</p>
<p>     UZBEK GDP		     JAN-SEPT 96	JAN-SEPT 95</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +1.5		 +0.3</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
